## Initial Risk Profile

Source stop is swing-based, TP is 1R. P2 uses `RISK_FIXED = 1000 USD`; live default remains `RISK_PERCENT = 0.25`.

## Implementation Notes

- Use closed H1 bars for EMA200 and AO state.
- AO green means current closed AO value is greater than the previous closed AO value.
